WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Start on all fours, wrists under shoulders, knees under hips.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Inhale and reach the right arm to the sky, opening the chest to the right.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Exhale and thread the right arm under the left, palm up, lowering the right shoulder and ear to the mat.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the hips high over the knees; let the upper back soften toward the floor.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Press the left palm down to unwind, and repeat on the other side.
